ites, I scraped 11 variables over a ten-day period every 10 min. Working with the web-scraped data, I generated correlations between each variables. I chose pandas scatter_matrix, seaborn heat map to visually visualize the relationship between data. Correlation Coefficients with numpy is checked in the process to directly show the highly correlated variables. Based on these statistical preparation, I transformed time series to supervised learning, before I made the forecasts with regression in machine learning. ","topics":[],"score":194518,"global_rank":329490},{"name":"lunatrifx/NVIDIA-FPS-Analysis","owner":"lunatrifx","html_url":"https://github.com/lunatrifx/NVIDIA-FPS-Analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"The NVIDIA app now allows for stats tracking for all things FPS and GPU! One of the biggest features is now tracking what DLSS does in terms of Frame Gen, Super Resolution, and Smooth Motion. Analysis will be run here. Hopefully no code. ","topics":["dlss","nvidia"],"score":194514,"global_rank":329499},{"name":"dc85/mobile_courses","owner":"dc85","html_url":"https://github.com/dc85/mobile_courses","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"C","description":null,"topics":[],"score":194514,"global_rank":329506},{"name":"sorohimm/sorohimm","owner":"sorohimm","html_url":"https://github.com/sorohimm/sorohimm","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":194513,"global_rank":329507},{"name":"willkurt/Flash-Card-for-the-Microsoft-Surface","owner":"willkurt","html_url":"https://github.com/willkurt/Flash-Card-for-the-Microsoft-Surface","stars":4,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"A generic flash card application for the Microsoft Surface, associate real-world object with 'flash cards' on the surface using byte tags.  This generica application is intended to have the user supply the content for the flashcards.","topics":[